note as PHYSICAL_INDEX_POLICY
  PHYSICAL INDEX POLICY
  - Primary keys of the series are their idempotency keys (see D-F1-2 c).
  - Every foreign key has a supporting BTREE index (leading column of a composite counts).
  - BRIN on the time column of every append-only table for retention scans and wide ranges.
  - Final inclusion is verified with EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS) on production-like volume;
    unused or redundant indexes are rejected.
end note

